{%- comment -%}
  The feed for feed readers. _includes/atom-feed.xml is the jekyll-feed
  plugin's template (version 0.17, trimmed to whats used; archived posts are
  not present). jekyll-feed skips making and overriding this feed while this
  file exists, but still adds the link to it in each page's <head>.

  Don't change how an entry's <id> is made: feed readers use it to tell
  posts apart, and would show every post as new again.
{%- endcomment -%}
